{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nia and The Abyss takes place in a dark, polluted, and dead ocean. As Nia, a newly formed ocean spirit, you restore balance to the Abyss by cleaning pollution, cultivating plant life, and attracting marine creatures. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Restore the Ocean</strong> \u2013 Remove pollution and clean up trash using Nia\u2019s abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Grow &amp; Cultivate</strong> \u2013 Revitalize the seafloor, plant seeds, and unlock new flora in unique ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Create a Living Ecosystem</strong> \u2013 Attract and help marine life with unique behaviors and interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Repurpose the Ruins</strong> \u2013 Destroy remnants of human waste and use the materials to influence the ocean\u2019s evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Uncover Hidden Lore</strong> \u2013 Discover ancient secrets that reveal more about humanity\u2019s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Dreamlike Underwater World</strong> \u2013 Hand-drawn aquatic life meets stylized 3D environments in a soothing, immersive, and melancholic experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585810?t=1772146795","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585810?t=1772146795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585810/8db9fe365e1445ce56c83d624554844aea547999/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772146795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585810/8db9fe365e1445ce56c83d624554844aea547999/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772146795","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nia and The Abyss takes place in a dark, polluted, and dead ocean. As Nia, a newly formed ocean spirit, you restore balance to the Abyss by cleaning pollution, cultivating plant life, and attracting marine creatures. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Restore the Ocean</strong> \u2013 Remove pollution and clean up trash using Nia\u2019s abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Grow &amp; Cultivate</strong> \u2013 Revitalize the seafloor, plant seeds, and unlock new flora in unique ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Create a Living Ecosystem</strong> \u2013 Attract and help marine life with unique behaviors and interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Repurpose the Ruins</strong> \u2013 Destroy remnants of human waste and use the materials to influence the ocean\u2019s evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Uncover Hidden Lore</strong> \u2013 Discover ancient secrets that reveal more about humanity\u2019s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Dreamlike Underwater World</strong> \u2013 Hand-drawn aquatic life meets stylized 3D environments in a soothing, immersive, and melancholic experience.</p>","developers":["PixelBlue Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co